# into this file.
# Flow (2026-11-20): Azshara moved to 50-60/02 (before Felwood, at 53-54, where its quests and mobs are at the
# player's level). This guide picks up at Thunder Bluff: Ratchet (Liv, Islen) -> Orgrimmar
# (bind, Silithus' emissary, training, cloth donations) -> zeppelin to the Undercity -> the Bulwark -> Felstone Field.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Barrens

step Fly to Ratchet
  fly "Ratchet"
  zone The Barrens

step Liv Rizzlefix
  tip Liv's workshop is at the north end of Ratchet's docks; Marvon's Chest stands inside it.
  turnin 4147                         -- Inside
  collect 10556 quest 3444.1          -- Stone Circle: Marvon's Chest

step Islen Waterseer
  tip Islen camps on the shore just south of Ratchet, at the water's edge.
  turnin 5158
  accept 5159
  note Cleansed Water goes to the Emerald Sanctuary in Felwood: keep it for later.

step Fly to Orgrimmar
  zone The Barrens
  goto 63.1,37.1 "Ratchet flight master"
  fly "Orgrimmar"
  zone Orgrimmar

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar

