  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Only if March of the Silithid isn't done yet: Zilzibin works in the Drag. Pestlezugg takes it in Gadgetzan on the Silithus guide's first stop, after Mount Hyjal.
  accept 4494

step Vehena
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip In the Valley of Spirits. Each donation takes sixty Wool, Silk or Mageweave from your bags: hand in what you carry, skip the rest.
  turnin 7833 direct optional
  turnin 7834 direct optional
  turnin 7835 direct optional

step Rashona Straglash
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip In the Valley of Honor.
  turnin 7826 direct optional
  turnin 7827 direct optional
  turnin 7831 direct optional
