step Felstone Field
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip Janice Felstone's farm is the first one east of the Bulwark. Cauldron Lord Bilemaw guards the cauldron in the field. Careful: one or two undead usually fight alongside him, and more cauldron lords can attack after you use the cauldron.
  collect 13194 quest 5229.1 @36.9,57.4 map 1422
  turnin 5229                         -- Scourge Cauldron
